cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Carolinas Regional Explorer data pipeline, please cite the working paper (preferred) or this repository."
title: "Carolinas Regional Explorer — Data Pipeline (crxp-data)"
abstract: "The open data pipeline that ingests public sources, computes small-area community indicators with propagated uncertainty, harmonizes geography, and produces the versioned data contract for the Carolinas Regional Explorer."
type: software
